<h1>The cluster index below 1024px</h1>
<p class="lede">The sidebar is <code>hidden lg:flex</code>, so under 1024&thinsp;px it disappeared entirely &mdash; no button, no hint the feature existed. Both captures are the same workspace at a 900&thinsp;px viewport.</p>
</header>
<figure><figcaption><span class="title">Before</span><span class="chip">main</span></figcaption>
